  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the quality of life in pineapple producing zones through community oversight</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Centro de Derecho Ambiental y de los Recursos Naturales (CEDARENA), in coordination with the Frente Nacional de Sectores Afectados por la Produccin Piera (FRENASSAP), will support 12 communities to monitor their water supply, develop and implement a community health surveys, and host public-private dialogues on environmental sustainability. About 200 persons from Pococ, Siquirres and Gucimo will participate in the activities and approximately 100,000 persons will benefit indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
